# A smaller model that fits entirely in 4 GB of VRAM.
#
# Measured on a GTX 1650 against the default 8B model (Modelfile):
#   about 5 times faster per call (42 s against 212 s on a 5,600-token prompt)
#   but 1 of 8 benchmark tasks solved, against 3 of 8.
#
# The weights come from Hugging Face. Note the licence: Qwen2.5-Coder-3B is
# released under the Qwen Research Licence, which does not allow commercial use.
#
#   ollama create forgeai-coder-3b -f infrastructure/ollama/Modelfile.fast
#
# then set LLM_MODEL=forgeai-coder-3b in .env.
FROM hf.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-3B-Instruct-GGUF:Q4_K_M
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
